      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1595b30fa4b9289121e8dd7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "全场观众为待兼诗歌剧的胜利\n献上震耳欲聋的喝采！",
      "source_fingerprint": "555370e69531fc16cd15a3ae39a6aa12391a43a75dabf61c6e6363330bb5f952",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1062/storytimeline_501062445.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e45d12b3cb385f4b93e32d0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "待兼诗歌剧为观众带来期待已久的胜利──\n“有马纪念”也就此落幕。",
      "source_fingerprint": "46df7a4bf6d9953a8b2407d2143a0eb444607d19ed256572d49319cd968ac73e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1062/storytimeline_501062445.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca40a09b1dddf2460c11ff23",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她一走出中山赛场的入口，就遇见一位\n陌生的年幼赛马娘表达对她的崇拜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce63ed69f4cdc76883df36b3eed7bdedaa3b76636d6f112fc4b7a13141df9241",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1062/storytimeline_501062445.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9891268f343bde8e21f87ce",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“虽然我是俱乐部里既没才能又跑最慢的人，\n但我不会输的！因为诗歌剧也跑到第一名了！”\n这番话让她难掩喜悦，逐渐展开笑容。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0838bd64faaa0253484de4a9bb30d2d1f78a6d9b1972c12ef9364116189f970",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1062/storytimeline_501062445.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4658f50938c0ed501d6e861",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“我成为那孩子心目中的‘主角’了，对吧？”\n她轻声地说道，并目送着那位年幼赛马娘离开，\n直到看不见那娇小的背影。",
      "source_fingerprint": "73ccb4835a2efa08d1035dcc11ab810ceffcfdc3aaf752bdee7a96cf00f74fce",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1062/storytimeline_501062445.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4e4c8da9debc71d07f86ea5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有马纪念结束后・期待已久的胜利",
      "source_fingerprint": "29a1d5d20e8fa45627fb8f56b298bd77fc6f8e0be5f2df73b5231ce69a44d4cd",
